          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 250,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Hail, men of the plains! I greet you with a proposal."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Daryn",
            text: _("What do these intruders want? We did not invite them here, that is certain."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("You know that my late uncle, King Garard II, was a friend of the clans. Your knights made up the cream of his army, and were venerated for their service. What prestige do you plainsmen hold under Asheviere, queen of the cities and employer of orcs?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Join us to overthrow the evil queen, and I will see the clans restored to prominence within the courts of Weldyn. Oppose us, and I will strip you of your power once the throne is rightfully reclaimed."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alric",
            text: _("Hah! You think you can seize the throne? You who are led by these youths and this old man?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Bayar",
            text: _("He will confront Asheviere, as he claims. Then he will die. And if we have lent our support it will be all the worse for us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lisar",
            portrait: "portraits/lisar-mad.webp",
            text: _("“These youths”, you dare call us? Don’t think me so weak that I cannot prove my worth in pitched battle."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Bayar",
            text: _("Hah! You would challenge us? I accept. Rout our clansmen and we will repudiate the queen. Or otherwise leave now and never return!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            portrait: "portraits/delfador-mad.webp",
            text: _("If you will not listen to reason, then so be it. Ready your lances, men of the plains!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ruga",
            text: _("Fools! We will run you down like dogs!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Daryn",
            text: _("There is no turning back for you now. You will not break us!"),
          },
          {
